  "settings.preheatDescription": "Heat the bed (and chamber, if supported) and hold at temperature before each queued print starts. Helpful for engineering filaments (PA, ABS) on printers without an active chamber heater — the bed warms the chamber by radiation while the soak timer runs. The bed target is read from the print file; chamber behaviour depends on printer model.",
